description: Never add Co-authored-by trailers to commits or messages
alwaysApply: true
---

# No co-authored trailers

Never add `Co-authored-by:` (or any co-author attribution) anywhere, including:

- Git commit subject or body
- Git commit message trailers / footers
- Pull request descriptions
- Chat replies or other written output

Unless the user explicitly asks for co-author attribution, keep all messages free of it.
